          "path": "_m/q/q/x/h/sukuh-wp/guardian-ogre-also-nat.jpg",
          "filename": "Ogre Statue, Candi Sukuh 1231.jpg",
          "caption": "This guardian, an ogre that is also a nature spirit, raises his club as if to defend the sanctuary behind him. His fangs, bulging eyes, and boxer's nose are characteristic; in Bali, people even today will file off the tips of their canine teeth, so as to lessen their resemblance to such a monstrous creature",
