          "filename": "Telaga Sarangan, Magetan 20180316.jpg",
          "caption": "Sarangan Lake, Magetan. Sarangan Lake is a lake with an area of approximately 30 hectares and a depth of around 28 metres located at the foot of Mount Lawu, the third highest mountain in Central Java, which lies on the border between Central Java and East Java provinces. Sarangan Lake itself is situated at an altitude of approximately 1,000 metres above sea level, making the air in this Magetan tourist spot quite cool with an average temperature of 18°C.",
